   "text": "Fig. 2 Amount and length of body hair of bees in granadilla crops. (a) Photographs of types of hairs found in the bees studied. (1) Long and abundant hairs, (2) Short and moderately abundant hairs, (3) Short and scarce hairs. (b) Comparison of the amount of body hair"
